    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "clots sound really scary, but i feel fine otherwise... i don't have a fever or anything. are you absolutely sure i need to go in right now? if i just wait a day or two to see if the ibuprofen works, what's the worst that could happen? it's probably fine if the swelling starts going down a little bit, right?",
